1
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:04,970
Empat puluh hari,

2
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:08,860
pagi dan petang, seorang raksasa menantang bangsa Israel.

3
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,230
Namanya Goliat,

4
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:13,200
prajurit Filistin setinggi hampir tiga meter.

5
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,350
Seluruh pasukan Raja Saul gemetar ketakutan.

6
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:18,610
Sementara itu, di Betlehem,

7
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:20,210
ada seorang gembala muda.

8
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:20,970
Daud,

9
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,140
anak bungsu Isai.

10
00:00:22,490 --> 00:00:24,910
Ia datang membawa bekal untuk kakak-kakaknya,

11
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:26,880
lalu mendengar tantangan itu.

12
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,070
Daud bertanya,

13
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:29,720
“Mengapa tak ada yang berani?”

14
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,610
Saul memberinya baju perang.

15
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:33,090
Namun Daud menolak.

16
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,240
Ia memilih yang ia kuasai.

17
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,070
Tongkat,

18
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:38,690
umban, dan lima batu licin dari sungai.

19
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:39,750
Itu saja.

20
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:40,810
Goliat mengejek.

21
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,330
Tapi Daud menjawab,

22
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:44,800
“Engkau datang dengan pedang dan tombak.

23
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:47,840
Aku datang dengan nama TUHAN semesta alam.”

24
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:49,160
Daud berlari.

25
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:50,430
Umban berputar.

26
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:51,670
Satu batu melesat.

27
00:00:51,930 --> 00:00:54,000
Batu itu mengenai dahi Goliat,

28
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,820
dan raksasa itu pun tumbang.

29
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:58,260
Pasukan Filistin lari tunggang-langgang.

30
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:01,460
Raksasa dalam hidupmu mungkin bukan musuh.

31
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:03,010
Tapi ketakutan.

32
00:01:03,290 --> 00:01:04,270
Dan seperti Daud,

33
00:01:04,410 --> 00:01:06,180
kamu tak perlu jadi yang terbesar.

34
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:08,180
Kamu hanya perlu percaya.

